   least £50.
 - Loyalty points are earned at 1 per whole pound paid for merchandise, and can
   pay for up to half the merchandise at 1p each.
+
+## Discount codes
+
+- A code is 3 to 20 letters, digits or hyphens. Codes aren't case-sensitive:
+  they're stored and returned in upper case. Creating a code that already exists
+  is a `conflict`.
+- `percent` is from 1 to 100.
+- `expires_on` is optional, e.g. `"2026-08-31"`. The code works until the end
+  of that day, UK time. It can't be in the past.
